<title>POLAND: POLISH C.BANK OFFERS PLN 800 MLN OF 91-DAY BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH C.BANK OFFERS PLN 800 MLN OF 91-DAY BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland offered to sell 800 million zlotys worth of its 91-day bills, maturing July 22, 1997, at a tender for Polish money market dealers.</p>
<p>The value date is April 22.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
